# One held note: detune swept from unison to wild at mix 128, then mix swept from the centre saw alone into the
# full sub, then detune swept back down (the stereo width closes below P1 32).
tempo 100
steps 24
tail 1.0
track lead
param p1 0
param p2 128
param attack 0
param sustain 255
param release 40
sweep p1 0 255 0 8
sweep p2 0 255 8 16
sweep p1 255 0 16 24
note 0 A3 24 127
expect sound 0 24
expect peak_below -4
